{
  "id": "207",
  "document": "静躁独行.txt",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "207:p0",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "$t1 == '207'?\r\n`",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48637:48653"
    },
    {
      "id": "207:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48653:48655"
    },
    {
      "id": "207:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你捶了捶枕头，躺在上面，努力找一个能睡着的舒服姿势。亚历克斯回来，迟疑了片刻，也爬了上来。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48655:48702"
    },
    {
      "id": "207:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“……宝贝？”她说。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48702:48714"
    },
    {
      "id": "207:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“怎么了？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48714:48722"
    },
    {
      "id": "207:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“你这就睡觉了吗？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48722:48734"
    },
    {
      "id": "207:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“要不然我还能干什么？停电了，我们这是在树林正中间。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48734:48763"
    },
    {
      "id": "207:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“好吧，抱歉。”亚历克斯翻过身，背朝着你。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48763:48786"
    },
    {
      "id": "207:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我们明天应该能把电视修好。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48786:48803"
    },
    {
      "id": "207:p9",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我不在乎。睡一会吧。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48803:48817"
    },
    {
      "id": "207:p10",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“好——”亚历克斯的声音弱下去。你们再没有说话。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48817:48843"
    },
    {
      "id": "207:p11",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "亚历克斯很快睡着了。你听着她的呼吸声放缓，慢慢变成熟睡的呼声。而你却久久不能入眠。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48843:48886"
    },
    {
      "id": "207:p12",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "松树的吱嘎声、寒风的呼啸声和其他无法分辨的奇异声音在黑山峰回响，萦绕在你身边。你在黑暗中沉默地躺着，焦虑让你心头像是有一把火。当困意终于战胜了你，真是一件幸事。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48886:48968"
    },
    {
      "id": "207:p13",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "在记录表上勾选 恐黑症。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48968:48982"
    },
    {
      "id": "207:p14",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "转到 34。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48982:48990"
    }
  ]
}
